      "text": "PRISMA flow chart (Figure A1, Review A) in two panels. English/Chinese literature: 1317 records in EMBASE, 1424 in Medline, 282 in the Chinese Biomedical Literature Database and 565 in China National Knowledge Infrastructure databases give 2271 records after removing duplicates; 2168 that do not report new skin tests are excluded, leaving 103 records for second screening and 0 records eligible. Russian literature: 405 records in e-library, 141 deemed not relevant, 264 for full-text review, all 264 excluded, giving 0 records potentially eligible; separately, 1 paper from a WHO public call for data yields 1 record eligible.",
